          {
            "title": "Start at zero",
            "id": 127014,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizinler 0'dan başlar ve sonraki her değerle birlikte artar. Bu, <code>temperatures</code> dizisindeki ikinci öğenin <code>1</code> dizininde olduğu anlamına gelir. O dizini kodla.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Access element",
            "id": 127015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>26</code> gibi bir öğeye erişmek için <code>temperatures</code> dizi adını, ardından köşeli parantezler içinde öğenin dizinini <code>[2]</code> kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve sonra <code>2</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Change value",
            "id": 127016,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci indisteki sıcaklık değerini güncellemek için <code>temperatures[2]</code> üzerinden ona eriş, ardından <code>=</code> kullanarak <code>25</code> gibi yeni bir değer ata.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[17, 20, 25, 24]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures[2]</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>25</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Valid index",
            "id": 127017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizide dört öğe olmasına rağmen erişebileceğimiz son indeks <code>3</code>'tür; çünkü indeksleme 0'dan başlar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[17, 25, 26, 20]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
